<title>USA: BankAmerica sees gain from unit offering.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica sees gain from unit offering.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica Corp said it began a public offering of 14 million shares of common stock of BA Merchant Services Inc at $15.50 per share.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the offering, assuming exercise of the over-allotment options, BankAmerica said it expects to recognize an after-tax gain of about $145 million in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The stock of the unit will trade on the New York Stock Exchange under &quot;BPI.&quot; Of the shares being offered, 11,200,000 are being offered in the U.S. and 2.8 million are being offered outside the United States.  </p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1700</p>
